{"UUID":"5c6307e2-c769-4242-bea0-37b7c885920b","DebugName":"Iasi_Refueling_Stanton_Hydrogen_1M_Easy","Type":"ContractGeneratorHandler_List","MissionType":{"UUID":"43e9d858-82ce-495a-8f1f-8daaba9f4022","Name":"RSI Discovery Event"},"MissionGiver":"United Wayfarers Club","Title":"RSI Disc. Month: Refuel Request (~mission(Ship))","TitleKey":"iasi_Refueling_E_Title_001","DisplayTitle":"RSI Disc. Month: Refuel Request ([Ship])","Description":"Hey!\n\nIf you're top notch refueller, this job might just interest you.\n\nPicked up a beacon at <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4> from a client who's flying a <EM4>~mission(Ship)</EM4> and needs <EM4>~mission(FuelType)</EM4> to help them out of a pinch. Looks like they were heading to that fancy new RSI Discovery location and forgot to refuel along the way. If I had a cred for every time I did that - well, let's just say I wouldn't be working here anymore!\n\nThe client vessel will pay you at the rate of ~mission(RefuelRequest), and as a United Wayfarers Club contractor, you will also qualify for the UWC service fee listed above upon completion.\n\nCan't imagine you'll run into any trouble, but that's exactly the kind of thing people say in those old vids right before they do. So keep an eye out for danger. \n\nHappy trails,\n\nDina Deloit\nDispatch Hub\nUnited Wayfarers Club\n\"\"We\u2019ve got your back\"\"","DescriptionKey":"iasi_Refueling_E_Desc_001","DisplayDescription":"Hey!\n\nIf you're top notch refueller, this job might just interest you.\n\nPicked up a beacon at <EM4>[Location|Address]</EM4> from a client who's flying a <EM4>[Ship]</EM4> and needs <EM4><EM4>[HydrogenFuel] SCU of Hydrogen Fuel</EM4></EM4> to help them out of a pinch. Looks like they were heading to that fancy new RSI Discovery location and forgot to refuel along the way. If I had a cred for every time I did that - well, let's just say I wouldn't be working here anymore!\n\nThe client vessel will pay you at the rate of <EM4>[FuelRate] aUEC per SCU of Hydrogen</EM4>, and as a United Wayfarers Club contractor, you will also qualify for the UWC service fee listed above upon completion.\n\nCan't imagine you'll run into any trouble, but that's exactly the kind of thing people say in those old vids right before they do. So keep an eye out for danger. \n\nHappy trails,\n\nDina Deloit\nDispatch Hub\nUnited Wayfarers Club\n\"\"We\u2019ve got your back\"\"","LocationPools":{"MissionLocationBP":{"Purpose":"Location","ResolvedLocations":[],"ResourceTags":[{"UUID":"6804b0a9-b01d-4c9a-8063-67784bd0f021","Name":"KillExclusive"}]}},"MissionTokens":{"FuelType":["<EM4>[HydrogenFuel] SCU of Hydrogen Fuel</EM4>"],"RefuelRequest":["<EM4>[FuelRate] aUEC per SCU of Hydrogen</EM4>"]},"CalculatedReward":true,"TimeToComplete":5,"CompletionTags":[{"UUID":"d26f3e42-d9b4-41dc-a52b-174833256dac","Name":"Transport","UnlocksMissions":[{"UUID":"f7d35419-10bc-4ec0-8ff0-173cf48b1f2d","Title":"RSI Disc. Month: Recover Package from Hijackers","DebugName":"Iasi_RecoverItem_Medium"},{"UUID":"b1a33d46-40d6-41be-a5d0-acf4fa9a4f90","Title":"RSI Disc. Month: High Value Package Retrieval Op","DebugName":"Iasi_RecoverItem_Hard"},{"UUID":"44cdae98-2ad6-4efe-8e27-d2bcadf4caf8","Title":"RSI Disc. Month: Important Supply Haul","DebugName":"Iasi_HaulCargo_AtoB_Supply_SecuritySupplies"},{"UUID":"701271ba-964f-4738-b489-1f38d9c40c4a","Title":"RSI Disc. Month: Ling Small Haul","DebugName":"Iasi_HaulCargo_AtoB_Small_PartySupplies"},{"UUID":"77dcf334-d868-497a-a781-de8f850dd48d","Title":"RSI Disc. Month: Ling Supply Delivery","DebugName":"Iasi_HaulCargo_AtoB_Supply_PartySupplies"},{"UUID":"48873cf2-04a8-4539-8d96-d16766045d1f","Title":"RSI Disc. Month: Package Recovery (Exp. JR)","DebugName":"Iasi_RecoverItem_Space_Medium"},{"UUID":"987cbdc8-4ee9-466f-99d7-054dcebe84e2","Title":"RSI Disc. Month: Package Recovery (Exp. S)","DebugName":"Iasi_RecoverItem_Space_Hard"},{"UUID":"1810871f-6ab7-4c47-92e9-64b9f889598d","Title":"RSI Disc. Month: Urgent Refuel Request (~mission